        key: "THE FALSIFIER IS A QUANTITY THAT MUST NOT CHANGE. In the single-carrier Drude model the transverse CONDUCTIVITY collapses with field -- measured, a factor of 29 as sigma_xx/sigma_0 falls 0.9948 to 0.0343 -- and yet the RESISTIVITY rho_xx moves by under 2% across that same collapse. THERE IS NO MAGNETORESISTANCE. The two are not in tension: rho is the INVERSE OF THE TENSOR, not the reciprocal of its diagonal, and inverting a 2x2 with off-diagonal terms restores the factor exactly (the closed form gives 3.548691e-5 at both B=0 and B=3, identical to twelve digits). SABOTAGE: writing rho_xx = 1/sigma_xx -- which is what the notation invites -- reports a 2796% magnetoresistance that does not exist, and it GROWS MONOTONICALLY WITH FIELD, so it looks like physics rather than like an error. The other key is why the measurement is useful at all: rho_xy = B/(nq) contains NO scattering time and NO effective mass, so tripling tau leaves it unmoved (-1.2544e-4 vs -1.2503e-4) while tripling rho_xx exactly. Measured against B/(nq) to 1.4% worst across a tenfold field range with wc*tau reaching 5.28, linear to 1.0%. And the SIGN of rho_xy is the sign of the carrier -- flipping it flips rho_xy and leaves rho_xx alone, which is the whole reason holes were discovered by measurement before band theory explained them. The transport is Monte Carlo with Poisson scattering and nothing in the integrator knows the closed form; the magnetic step is a Boris rotation preserving speed to 1e-15, because a Euler step gains 6.2e-4 per step and would appear as exactly the magnetoresistance this device exists to say is absent.",
