      key: "Partition of unity is EXACTLY 1 (1.110e-16); linear momentum reaches the grid to round-off; and APIC carries ANGULAR momentum exactly -- 64.155 to the grid's 64.155 -- where PIC loses 25.53%. THE PLANT SCORES BETTER ON LINEAR MOMENTUM THAN THE HONEST ARM.",
